  "packages/desktop-client is named @actual-app/web and packages/loot-core @actual-app/core: unit names differ from their folders",
  "@actual-app/web declares every dependency, React and React Router included, as a devDependency because Vite bundles them",
  "Capacitor is declared by both @actual-app/web (core and plugins) and mobile-client (the android and ios platforms)",
  "the root package actual declares Vitest for the workspace-wide test run; lage runs the per-package scripts",
  "the bank-sync services (GoCardless Bank Account Data, Enable Banking, SimpleFIN Bridge, Akahu, Pluggy) live in packages/sync-server/src/app-*: two have an SDK, the others are plain base URLs",
  "SQLite is the store of both the client (sql.js, absurd-sql, better-sqlite3 in loot-core) and the sync server; the compose files start only Actual's own containers",
  "packages/docs/static/fly.toml is a downloadable example for users, not this repository's deployment",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
